  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "review-6d96a60274ae-1-review-1",
      "kind": "blocking",
      "status": "resolved",
      "acceptance_id": "AC1",
      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 1,
      "summary": "P1 — plugins/immune-brain/runtime/unattended/batch_ref.ts:96–99：exclusive creation 仍会解引用 foreign symbolic Parent ref。用户已有 refs/heads/imm/parent → refs/heads/user-new，且目标尚不存在时，readBatchRef 将其视为 absent，update-ref 的 zero-old-value CAS 随后创建 user-new 并返回成功，违反碰撞时不得修改用户 refs 的要求。应拒绝 symbolic Parent refs，并确保 mutation-boundary 操作不会解引用它们；在 tests/batch-parent-branch.test.ts 增加 dangling symbolic Parent 的拒绝与 refs 保持不变断言。",
      "anchor": "sha256:ee608bec74d21442c6c91750409a22e673a4ad34e8eda0f47072f8f3661b669a",
      "evidence": {
        "trigger": "用户预先创建 dangling symbolic ref refs/heads/imm/parent → refs/heads/user-new，且没有 batch provenance → runBatchGitPreflight 调用 createBatchRef；git update-ref 默认解引用 symbolic ref，在 user-new 上成功执行 zero-old-value CAS，创建用户命名的目标分支并错误报告 Parent 创建成功，而不是保留资源并拒绝。",
        "caller_chain": [
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/unattended/batch_git.ts:runBatchGitPreflight",
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/unattended/batch_preflight.ts:parentBranchProvenance",
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/unattended/batch_ref.ts:createBatchRef"
        ],
        "violated": {
          "kind": "acceptance",
          "ref": "AC1"
        }
      },
      "counterevidence": null
    },
    {
      "id": "review-98b1d85c6d47-1-review-1",
      "kind": "blocking",
      "status": "resolved",
      "acceptance_id": "AC1",
      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 2,
      "summary": "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/unattended/batch_worktrees.ts:47–51 的 Lane 路径创建仍不具备排他性：existsSync 检查后，并发创建的空目录会被 git worktree add 接管并写入 checkout；若目录非空，则 worktree add 拒绝，但此前创建的 Lane ref 已遗留。应在创建 ref 前排他地预留目标目录，拒绝接管他人先创建的路径，并在 tests/batch-parent-branch.test.ts 增加确定性的并发路径碰撞回归，断言外来目录内容、refs 和 worktree registrations 不变。",
      "anchor": "sha256:3d43793ffdae417768e1b647bf891525d58b00380a2d47d8324946b4b6cc5b50",
      "evidence": {
        "trigger": "目标 Lane 路径和 branch 初始均不存在；另一进程在第 47 行 existsSync 返回 false 后、第 51 行 worktree add 前创建目标目录 → 空目录被自动采用并填入 checkout，随后可被保存为合法 Lane binding；非空目录导致创建失败，但第 50 行已创建的 Lane ref 仍保留。两种结果都违反碰撞应拒绝且不改变资源的约束。现有静态碰撞检查只覆盖检查前已存在的资源，未覆盖这一 observation-to-mutation 排他性缺口。",
        "caller_chain": [
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/unattended/batch_lanes.ts:runLaneBatch",
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/unattended/batch_worktrees.ts:createLaneWorktree",
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/unattended/batch_worktrees.ts:assertLaneWorktreeAvailable"
        ],
        "violated": {
          "kind": "acceptance",
          "ref": "AC1"
        }
      },
      "counterevidence": null
    }
  ],
